7.8pt; min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">各学院、相关本科生：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">为确保物理实验课程教学任务的顺利实施，现将相关事项安排如下。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 21px;">一、2025级本科生《物理实验（Ⅱ）》（24PY2010）选课安排</span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 7.8pt; min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 31.35pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; min-height: 16pt;">物理实验采用自主预约式选课模式，按照2024版教学大纲要求，每生必须完成24学时的线下实验项目和3学时的线上实验和测试。</span><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt;">线下实验项目选课分阶段分批次实施，具体安排如下：</span></span></p><table class="first-row first-col no-vband" style="width: 447.2pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 57.4pt;"><col style="width: 56.7pt;"><col style="width: 128.1pt;"><col style="width: 205pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 22.5pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 11pt; font-size: 11pt;">阶段</span></p></td><td style="border-top: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: 1pt solid black; vertical-align: middle;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 11pt; font-size: 11pt;">批次</span></p></td><td style="border-top: 1pt solid black; border-left: none;